The basic idea of your project is:

A web application that connects with Google Meet and Google Calendar, shows the user's meetings in one place, allows them to join meetings directly, captures the meeting's speech, converts it into text, and then uses AI to organize the meeting content into useful formats such as documents, summaries, and flashcards.

Simple flow

Google Account Authentication
↓
Sync Google Calendar + Google Meet meetings
↓
Show upcoming/past meetings in your application
↓
User clicks "Join Meeting"
↓
Meeting happens → capture speech
↓
Speech-to-Text
↓
AI processes the transcript
↓
Organized output

📝 Meeting document / notes
🧠 Flashcards
📌 Important points
✅ Action items
📋 Summary
🔑 Key decisions
